  "result": "`src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts` decides the number. The `nextIssueNumber` function there takes the `max(number)` over every issue row in the given org and project, including archived ones, and returns that plus one. Because the query filters on both `orgId` and `projectId`, each project counts from 1 independently.\n\nThe flow for a new issue: `createIssue` in `src/server/services/issue-service.ts` calls `nextIssueNumber`, then passes the result to `insertIssue` in the same repository file. `src/server/db/schema/issues.ts` defines a unique index on `(projectId, number)`, which guards against duplicates but does not choose the value.\n\nANSWER: src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts",
